# Tester layer ownership

- **Write**: tests and fixtures under `client/**` and `server/**` matching `*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`, `*.integration.test.ts`, `*.e2e.test.ts`.
- **Do not**: change product behavior just to make tests pass; hide production fixes inside tests; skip retry/duplicate scenarios for sync features.

Prefer realistic fixtures; mock at provider boundaries (Google/QuickBooks), not entire orchestration when behavior must be verified. Validate persisted state where it matters. Align with `.agents/tester/AGENTS.md`.
